# sessions/ is versioned on purpose, from 23/09/2026. The protocol calls
# the diffs and transcripts archived evidence and the project plan lists
# them among the published artefacts, but they were ignored here and so
# existed only on one machine. Everything a session produces is kept --
# logs and per-step transcripts included -- because deciding later that
# something was irrelevant is cheap to get wrong and the whole collection
# is well under a hundred megabytes.
.env
.env.bak-*
